# arms/adult/action/twohand/spear_l: the left (off) arm of the spear family, both bodies (P2c SLICE-ARMS 2026-10-23;
# STYLE_P2 25.8 items 5 and 11). Keys: sp_guard (the drawn idle, walk and run: levelled at the hip, tip forward), sp_wind
# (both fists drawn to the back hip, weight back: the loaded pose), sp_hit (the thrust at full reach, the off hand slid
# up toward the rear fist: 8 > 6 px apart), sp_pull (the shaft pulled back), sp_block (the haft across the body). Facing
# right drawn from the loco arms' vocabulary; facing left the same pose from the other side, repainted (the light from
# the top-left, the far arm a value darker), never the plain mirror. The right fist marks `grip` (the spear's origin),
# the left `gripL` on the haft line (C3d: within 1 px; kn_check in the area report). Regions U F C H (mail, plate and
# gloves recolour the drawing). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role arms std
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L
z 1

